OL,4,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,5,     GStar soprano Ermonela Jaho and
OL,6,     Gtenor Thomas Elwin join the BBC
OL,7,     GConcert Orchestra and conductor
OL,8,     GJohn Andrews in favourite arias.
OL,9,     GRecorded at West Green Opera,
OL,10,     GHampshire.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Almost Famous
OL,12,     GIan Sansom reflects on obscurity
OL,13,     Gas an index of cultural values
OL,14,     Gthrough five figures whose near-
OL,15,     Gfame offers a map of shifting
OL,16,     Gtastes. Today: recording engineer
OL,17,     GHolger Czukay.
OL,18,G2200FLate Junction
OL,19,     GJoin Verity Sharp as we enjoy the
